{
  "slug": "wordpress-mcp",
  "name": "Wordpress Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Manage WordPress sites directly from Claude using the WordPress MCP Adapter. Connect Claude to any WordPress 6.9+ site and manage content, users, settings, and WooCommerce — all through conversation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `wp-admin` (WordPress site administration through the MCP Adapter), `wp-content` (Manage WordPress content through the MCP Adapter), `wp-woocommerce` (WooCommerce store management through the WordPress MCP Adapter)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `wordpress`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wordpress-mcp@claude-community` from `MSApps-Mobile/claude-plugins` (`plugins/wordpress-mcp`).",
